From a06e3e4f0aa27e16a804bf912b83cf5a00246da5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 01:46:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] test-posix: Check the expansions, flags and errors of
 wordexp, and <wordexp.h>

test-wordexp-expand checks tilde, parameter, command and arithmetic
expansion, field splitting with IFS, pathname expansion in a fresh
directory, quote removal, each WRDE_ flag, WRDE_BADCHAR for each special
character, what each error leaves in the wordexp_t and cancellation.
test-wordexp_h checks the type, constants, prototypes and namespace.
